  "ayuda.copia.t": "Backup and other devices", "ayuda.copia.x": "<p>The app stores everything only in this browser. To avoid losing it, or to use it on another phone or computer, you have two options:</p><p><b>Encrypted backup</b>: downloads a file protected with a password only you know (AES-256 encryption on your own device). Keep it anywhere; nobody can open it without the password, not even us, so do not forget it.</p><p><b>Move to another device</b>: shows a QR code (or a link) with your data. Opening it on the other device copies it there. The link carries your data inside: do not share it.</p>",
