  "tour.anadir.t": "Other ways to add it", "tour.anadir.x": "Photo of the medication sheet, PDF, pasted list, dictation or the barcode on the box: this button has them all.",
  "tour.informe.t": "Your plan, here", "tour.informe.x": "As soon as there is medication the verdict, the essentials, the detail by exercise type and the PDFs for your doctor, for you or for your trainer appear.",
